AICompass – Conversational AI Literacy Guide
 
Abstract:
This project aims to develop a conversational AI platform that helps users understand AI concepts, risks, and ethics.
 
Introduction:
AI is widely used in modern applications but lacks user awareness.
 
Objectives:
- Explain AI concepts
- Provide chatbot interaction
- Teach ethics and bias
 
Architecture:
User → Frontend → Backend → Chatbot → Database
 
Features:
- Chatbot
- AI modules
- Simple UI
 
Conclusion:
The system improves AI literacy through conversational interaction.


